      file: "README.md:42"
      content: '"0 TODO/FIXME/unimplemented!" (meta-statement, not actual placeholder)'
      resolution: "Verified by grep — the text SAYS there are 0 TODOs, not that it IS a TODO"
    - id: D2
      severity: real
      file: "docs/premium/index.md:102"
      content: '"W9 | Documentation Premium Elite (this wave) | 🔄 | TBD"'
      resolution: "Fixed in Phase 5 — updated to ✅ + TOON checkpoint path"
    - id: D3
      severity: info
      file: "docs/faq.md (2 instances)"
      content: "Anchor links `#how-do-i-install-tesseract-for-ocr-features` and `#how-do-i-install-without-ocr-support` do not exist on the page"
      resolution: "mkdocs --strict does not block on these (INFO only); section anchors were renamed in earlier edit. Could be fixed by updating faq.md to use the current anchor names."
  out_of_scope_findings:
